sequenceDiagram
    participant W as Worker (ticket branch)
    participant O as Orchestrator (user's machine)
    participant U as User
    W->>W: build, self-review
    W->>W: write agent/show/<feature>/demo-NN.sh
    W->>W: run it, paste that run's output under the command
    W->>O: closing comment: landed line, Demo, I need from you, Details
    O->>O: dispatch review: warn if no demo file and no Demo line
    O->>O: run demo-NN.sh here
    O->>U: open its output beside the review page
    U->>O: ruling: accept, amend, redo, reject
    O->>W: amend: comments as guidance on resume
    O->>O: accept: merge --no-ff, dependents on the frontier
